Start: "Start here · Native allocation\nKeep the binding search contract" {class: start}
Facts: "Value is separate from health\nEmpty / nil / apparently successful call\nCannot certify negative facts"
Direct: "Direct owned inspection\nIdentity / canonical calls fit\nRegistration / native types unresolved"
Trace: "Opaque inspection in Koine\nComplete approved-posture observer\nNot established by feasibility"
Helper: "Declined alternative · finite-table helper\nCould contain per-process FD demand\nNecessity not established" {style: {fill: "#E5EAF0"; stroke-width: 2}}
Scope: "Human answer · helper not approved\nRetain Koine's single-process posture\nChild-limit question inapplicable" {shape: diamond}
Continue: "Continue in process\nOwned semantic route or complete observer\nStill required; no silent weakening"
Budget: "Two host temporary credits\nOwned + opaque demand need a contract\nNo root-credit borrowing"
Health: "Negative-fact proof remains required\nCFError or finite table is insufficient\nNo implicit UNKNOWN-only weakening"
Lifetime: "Own blocked workers + late returns\nRetain charges through worker cleanup\nProvider restart does not reset refusal"
Contract: "Complete in-process allocation design next\nResolve call health / demand / recovery\nKeep host limits, domain, grants + seams"
Listener: "Observe accept before NIO suppression\nError / delay / scheduled read / resume\nEventual replies do not clear backoff"
Subjects: "Then construct independent subjects\nTransient-open + suppressed-error controls\nFour searches beside listener / store / actions"
Pending: "Mandatory complete-resource review\nBefore planning\nNative + binary + useful coverage pending"
